{
  "_doc": "Tier-3 school on Larch Street (Pell's Crossing, lot 'school', the third block; front faces the street). Two storeys of brick round a double-height gym (ADR-0021): bleachers, a stage under a proscenium, hoops and wall bars, open to the roof trusses, with the lights catwalk along its south side on the upper floor; a boiler-room cellar under the nurse's wing. It was the north valley's Cordon evacuation point. Route: the front doors boarded by the Cordon -> round the west side to Mrs Dale's classroom window -> the cross hall: the gym doors boarded from this side -> the corridor and the stairs -> the teachers' workroom (opening its door wakes it) -> the lights catwalk: loose boards over the gym, Agnes Whitlow and the boiler-room key (the boards and the key wake the families below) -> drop into the gym (one way) -> the nurse's office (triage) -> the back stair hall -> down to the boiler room -> the isolation room (key; a shotgun inside the door; Lt. Okonkwo guards the antifungal stores: loot) -> up again: unbolt the back door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
